Total Changes: 69

[IMP] project: add readonly collaborator access mode

Before this commit, read-only access for external users was strictly tied
to the mail follower system. Portal users could only view projects and
tasks by being added as followers, which restricted them to the basic
server-rendered portal view rather than the full Project Sharing interface.
Furthermore, this access was fragile: if a portal user unfollowed a
specific task, they instantly lost visibility of it.

After this commit, read-only access is decoupled from followers and
integrated directly into the Project Sharing architecture.

* Replaced the boolean `limited_access` field on `project.collaborator`
  with a new `access_mode` selection field ('view', 'edit', 'advanced_edit').
* External users granted 'view' access now benefit from the full Project
  Sharing

